/// Inbound app health — the application liveness probe. Dapr calls it when
/// app health checks are enabled (`GET /healthz` over HTTP,
/// `AppCallbackHealthCheck.HealthCheck` over gRPC). `ok` means healthy.
/// https://docs.dapr.io/operations/resiliency/health-checks/app-health/
interface health-callback {
  use types.{app-error};

  /// Report application health. An `app-error` (or a trap) marks the app
  /// unhealthy to the sidecar.
  health-check: func() -> result<_, app-error>;
}
